What does this simplified bearer check accept and reject?
```python
import hmac
EXPECTED = 's3cret'
def authorised(header):
    if not header or not header.startswith('Bearer '):
        return False
    return hmac.compare_digest(header[7:], EXPECTED)
print(authorised('Bearer s3cret'), authorised('Bearer wrong'), authorised(None), authorised('s3cret'))
```

